    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293686,293732</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オリジンと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What to do with Origin?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>来たか……
大体の用件はわかっている</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So thou hast come... I know, more
or less, what business brings thee.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私と戦いたい、
それとも力を借りたい……
いずれかだと思うが</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Either thou wishest to do battle
with me, or thou wishest to
borrow my power...or so I think.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292584</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よし。では、
相手しようではないか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alright. Then, shall
I be thy opponent?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292664</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この私が負けるとはな。
……また、来るがいい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's hard to believe I've
lost. ...Come again.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292844</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オリジン！
オレらに力を貸してくれ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Origin! Lend us your power!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292952</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よかろう。
汝らは私と戦い、勝った</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Very well. Thou hast
defeated me in battle.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>292952</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>その実力を認め、
契約しようではないか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Shall we form a pact,
acknowledging that strength?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293080</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我、今、根源の精に
ねがいたてまつる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Here and now, I offer my request
to the Almighty Spirit of Creation.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293080</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>指輪の盟約のもと、
我に精霊を従わせたまえ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>By covenant of the ring,
may this spirit obey me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293080</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我が名は&lt;Dio&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My name is &lt;Dio&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我の力は
汝のものではない。
奢るではないぞ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Act not in pride.
This power is
not thine own.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293360</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>契約の指輪を持たぬ者とは
契約はできぬ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I cannot form a pact with one
who does not hold a pact ring.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>293360</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ダイヤモンドを持って、
再度、来るといい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Come again when you
have a Diamond Ring.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
